{{also|Fett}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|gml|vet}}, from {{der|de|osx|*fētid}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*faitidaz}}. Compare [[High German]] {{m|de|feist}} from the same root.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fɛt/|lang=de}}

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|er|fettesten}}

# [[fat]]
#: {{ux|de|'''Fette''' Menschen sind oft ungesund.|'''Fat''' people are often unhealthy.}}
# {{lb|de|of food}} [[rich]], containing a lot of fat
# {{lb|de|typography}} [[bold]]
#: {{ux|de|In diesem Satz ist nur das Wort „'''fett'''“ '''fett''' geschrieben.|In this sentence, only the the word "'''bold'''" is written in '''bold'''.}}
# {{lb|de|colloquial}} [[awesome]], [[phat]]
#: {{ux|de|Das war echt '''fett'''.|This was really '''awesome'''.}}
#: {{ux|de|Sie hat 'nen '''fetten''' Vertrag an Land gezogen.|She got a very '''profitable''' contract.}}

